# Owners for the critical and sensitive merge tiers (.agents/merge-policy.json).
# No tier requires a code owner's review: agents merge on proof, and GitHub
# refuses approval of one's own pull request. This file routes review requests
# and names who answers for each gated path; routine paths have no owner here.

# Sensitive: steward UI, intake pages and forms, notifications and email,
# fixture providers, tests and check scripts, Notion import scripts, guidance
